      <title>Lebanon Emergency Relief Fundraiser</title>
      <link>https://refugeworldwide.com/news/lebanon-emergency-relief-fundraiser</link>
      <description>This Sunday we’re gathering at a DIY venue (near Jannowitzbrücke) to raise emergency relief funds for people in Lebanon. The funds will be carried directly by trusted individuals working on the ground. The event is hosted in collaboration with Root Radio, Global South United and Egyptian Diaspora.</description>
