      <title>We Are Hiring: Part-Time Position</title>
      <link>https://refugeworldwide.com/news/we-are-hiring-again</link>
      <description>Refuge Worldwide is looking for a motivated, organised and adaptable person to join our team in Berlin. This is a mini-job role supporting multiple parts of our space - radio, events and café - so we’re looking for someone with a broad skill set and confidence working across creative, technical and hospitality environments.</description>
