    <item>
      <title>Berlin Stories</title>
      <link>https://refugeworldwide.com/news/berlin-stories-19-march-02-april</link>
      <description>Lilipad is a German-Moroccan nonprofit organisation providing educational resources and safe, creative spaces for children at high risk of social exclusion. Founded in 2017 in Berlin, the organisation focuses on children at the highest risk of marginalisation, particularly those affected by displacement, poverty or stigma. On 26 March, Lilipad hosts an evening gathering to learn more about their work and ways to get involved. The event will take place at Scaling Spaces – Curvy Campus Berlin from</description>
