    <item>
      <title>Free Open Air - May Day 2026</title>
      <link>https://refugeworldwide.com/news/may-day-2026</link>
      <description>This Friday 1st May from 12:00-22:00, Refuge Worldwide takes to Beach Neukölln for a ten-hour, two stage open-air party. We've got thirteen DJs from the station coming in hot, food stalls, and a fresh soundsystem installation for what will be our first ever May Day without Oona Bar.</description>
